	(text_box "NOTES\n- Unused GPIOs are left unconnected (X).\n- Strapping pins GPIO45 / GPIO46 are left floating; the internal pull-downs give the default boot configuration.\n- The module PCB antenna sits at the board edge: copper keep-out on all layers under and around it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
